# Managed by Ansible (roles/common). Key-only SSH, enforced here instead of
# trusting cloud-init / the LXC template (the runner LXCs shipped with
# PasswordAuthentication yes). Loaded before the distro's 50-/60- drop-ins,
# and sshd keeps the first value it reads, so these win.
PasswordAuthentication no
KbdInteractiveAuthentication no
PermitEmptyPasswords no
# The runner LXCs are managed as root, with a key only.
PermitRootLogin prohibit-password
X11Forwarding no
